      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Throne Room</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œCatra, what are you doing?!â€ Catra growled:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œDonâ€™t think this is easy for me! Trust me, Adora, I donâ€™t want to do this but you leave me no choice! Yes, I betrayed you, but you betrayed me first! And youâ€™ll keep hurting me and the rest of Etheria unless I stop you right now!â€ Catra began to choke up when she said that last bit. Adora began to hyperventilate:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œCatra, what are you doing?! STOP!â€ Using her claws, Catra cut through the webbing holding Adoraâ€™s right arm up, causing it to fall by her side. The feline sniffled as she said:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œIâ€™m so sorry, Adora. I really am going to miss youâ€¦but youâ€™re too far gone for me to saveâ€¦ for anyone to saveâ€¦â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œCATRA!â€ With that, Catra cut the remaining webs, causing Adora to fall and desperately grab onto a rock on the way to her supposedly guaranteed demise. As Catra walked away, the blonde screamed:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYOUâ€™LL PAY FOR THIS, CATRA! YOU HEAR ME?! YOUâ€™LL PAY FOR THIS!â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is yet another Horde Adora AU because my favorite one has not been updated since 2020 and I wanted to finish it. Love you LadyLazuli97! ;)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
